TASK 6 – Design the Inheritance Hierarchy (4 Marks)
1. Superclass and Subclasses
In the Parking Management System, Vehicle is the superclass. Car, Bike, Bus and ElectricCar are subclasses.

This uses hierarchical inheritance because multiple classes inherit from one superclass. ElectricCar also extends Car, forming multilevel inheritance.
- Vehicle: Contains common fields such as vehicle number and vehicle type.
- Car: Inherits Vehicle and adds seating capacity.
- Bike: Inherits Vehicle and adds engine capacity.
- Bus: Inherits Vehicle and adds passenger capacity.
- ElectricCar: Inherits Car and adds battery capacity.
