5. Alternative Concept – Composition vs Inheritance
Composition means a Vehicle object contains a VehicleType object that stores vehicle category and parking rate.
Comparison	Inheritance	Composition
Design	Car extends Vehicle	Vehicle has VehicleType
Adding new type	Create a new subclass	Create a new VehicleType
Fee calculation	Use subclass-specific method	Use VehicleType rate
Flexibility	Less flexible for changing types	More flexible
Time complexity	O(1)	O(1)
Space per vehicle	Object fields + subclass fields	Vehicle fields + VehicleType reference
